{"id": "s-0301", "domain": "medieval kingdom", "names": ["King", "Knight", "Peasant"], "text": "In my kingdom the King commands the Knight and the Knight commands the Peasant. Please draw the two arrows. Then make the king gold and large, and shrink the peasant to tiny. Who is the most connected person in the chain?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "King,Knight,Peasant", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "King", "color": "gold", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Peasant", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}]}
{"id": "s-0302", "domain": "zombie game", "names": ["Base", "Mall", "Hospital"], "text": "Survivors move from the Base to the Mall and then to the Hospital. Connect them, and the arrow into the Hospital should be red, it's dangerous. Make the Base a green hexagon. Do you see a path from Base to Hospital?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Base,Mall,Hospital", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Mall", "to": "Hospital", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Base", "shape": "hexagon", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Base", "to": "Hospital"}}]}
{"id": "s-0303", "domain": "photo app", "names": ["Crop", "Filter", "Save"], "text": "Mockup of an editing app. Put Crop at the left, Filter in the center, Save at the right. Make Save blue, it's the primary button. Wait, can you check if Filter is bigger than Crop?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Crop", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Filter", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Save", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Save", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Filter", "comparison": "bigger", "anchor": "Crop"}}]}
{"id": "s-0304", "domain": "wine making", "names": ["Grapes", "Press", "Barrel"], "text": "Grapes get crushed in the Press and the juice goes into the Barrel. Draw it for me. The Grapes are purple, the Barrel is brown, and make the Barrel big. By the way, what shape is the Press?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Grapes,Press,Barrel", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Grapes", "color": "purple"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Barrel", "color": "brown", "size": "large"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Press", "property": "shape"}}]}
{"id": "s-0305", "domain": "kindergarten", "names": ["Circle1", "Square1", "Triangle1"], "text": "The kids are learning shapes, so Circle1 must be a circle, Square1 a square, and Triangle1 a triangle. If they aren't, change them. After that, paint all the circles yellow, all the squares red. Please make the triangle bigger too.", "wires": [{"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Circle1", "shape": "circle"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Square1", "shape": "square"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Triangle1", "shape": "triangle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "mention(quantifier=all,shape=circle)", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "mention(quantifier=all,shape=square)", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Triangle1"}}]}
{"id": "s-0306", "domain": "fraud detection", "names": ["Txn", "Rules", "Review"], "text": "Every Txn passes the Rules engine. If it's suspicious it goes to Review. So connect Txn to Rules and Rules to Review. Rules should be an orange diamond. Do I have any cycle in here?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Txn,Rules,Review", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Rules", "shape": "diamond", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}]}
{"id": "s-0307", "domain": "mall", "names": ["Food", "Shoes", "Toys"], "text": "I want the Food court in the center of the mall, with Shoes on one side and Toys on the other. So Shoes left of Food, Toys right of Food. Make Toys cyan. Which shape sits rightmost?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Food", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Shoes", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Food"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Toys", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Food"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Toys", "color": "cyan"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "rightmost"}}]}
{"id": "s-0308", "domain": "lab protocol", "names": ["Sample", "Spin", "Read"], "text": "Sample goes to Spin and Spin goes to Read, with dashed arrows. Make Spin a circle. Then it needs to be tiny, because it is the centrifuge. How many dashed... sorry, how many connections do we have?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Sample,Spin,Read", "pairing": "chain", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Spin", "shape": "circle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Spin", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "kind": "edge"}}]}
{"id": "s-0309", "domain": "design system", "names": ["Button", "Input", "Card"], "text": "Okay, the buttons in our design system are blue rectangles. Make Button that. The Input is a white rectangle. And the Card, well, it's a large white square. Then list all the white shapes.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Button", "shape": "rectangle", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Input", "shape": "rectangle", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Card", "shape": "square", "size": "large", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "color": "white"}}]}
{"id": "s-0310", "domain": "canal", "names": ["Lock1", "Lock2", "Basin"], "text": "The boats go through Lock1, then Lock2, finally into the Basin. Arrows please. Lock1 and Lock2 line up vertically. The Basin is a big blue ellipse. Also tell me where the Basin is.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Lock1,Lock2,Basin", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "Lock1,Lock2", "axis": "vertical"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Basin", "shape": "ellipse", "size": "large", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Basin", "property": "position"}}]}
{"id": "s-0311", "domain": "dating app", "names": ["Profile", "Match", "Chat"], "text": "profile -> match -> chat, thats the flow of the app. connect them. then make the Match a pink star cuz people love it. whats the neighbors of Match, just to chek?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Profile,Match,Chat", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Match", "shape": "star", "color": "pink"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Match"}}]}
{"id": "s-0312", "domain": "hospital", "names": ["Lab", "Xray", "Ward"], "text": "Swap the Lab with the Xray, the corridor is on the other side. Put the Ward at the bottom and make it white. Next add an ellipse called Entrance above the Lab. Then link it to the Lab.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "swap", "target": "Lab,Xray"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Ward", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Ward", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "ellipse", "name": "Entrance", "position": "above", "anchor": "Lab"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "$new", "to": "Lab"}}]}
{"id": "s-0313", "domain": "fish tank", "names": ["Filter", "Heater", "Plant"], "text": "For the fish tank diagram put the Filter on the left and the Heater on the right. Put the Plant in the middle, between them. Colour the plant green. Is the Plant between the Filter and the Heater now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Filter", "position": "left"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Heater", "position": "right"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Plant", "position": "between", "anchor": "Filter,Heater"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Plant", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Plant", "position": "between", "anchor": "Filter,Heater"}}]}
{"id": "s-0314", "domain": "api gateway", "names": ["Public", "Private", "Admin"], "text": "Public is open to all, so make it green. Private is for logged-in users, which makes it yellow. And Admin is red, of course. Join them in a chain from Public to Admin. Is Admin reachable from Public?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Public", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Private", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Admin", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Public,Private,Admin", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "reachable", "from": "Public"}}]}
{"id": "s-0315", "domain": "space", "names": ["Rocket", "Moon"], "text": "The Rocket must fly to the Moon: draw a dashed arrow. Let me add 5 tiny white stars, scattered. Make them all gold instead... I changed my mind, leave them white. Then the Rocket goes to the bottom of the canvas.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Rocket", "to": "Moon", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "star", "size": "tiny", "color": "white", "count": "5"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Rocket", "position": "bottom"}}]}
{"id": "s-0316", "domain": "scouts", "names": ["Troop", "Patrol1", "Patrol2"], "text": "The Troop has two patrols, Patrol1 and Patrol2. Attach them to the Troop using arrows. Patrol1 is lime and Patrol2 is orange, so nobody mixes them up. Shrink the Troop, it's the smaller group. Is the Troop smaller than Patrol1?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Troop", "to": "Patrol1,Patrol2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Patrol1", "color": "lime"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Patrol2", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Troop"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Troop", "comparison": "smaller", "anchor": "Patrol1"}}]}
{"id": "s-0317", "domain": "storage", "names": ["Hot", "Warm", "Cold"], "text": "A storage tiering diagram, ok. Hot is red, Warm is orange, Cold is blue. Then lay them out in a column, with Hot at the top. Is it true the Cold one is bigger than the Hot one?", "wires": [{"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Hot", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Warm", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Cold", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Hot,Warm,Cold", "layout": "column"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Cold", "comparison": "bigger", "anchor": "Hot"}}]}
{"id": "s-0318", "domain": "cinema", "names": ["Ticket", "Popcorn", "Seat"], "text": "Get rid of the Popcorn shape, I'm cutting snacks from the plan. Draw an arrow from Ticket to Seat. Create a gray circle in the bottom left, for the usher. Undo that, actually, no usher.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "delete", "target": "Popcorn"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Ticket", "to": "Seat"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "gray", "position": "bottomLeft"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "undo"}}]}
{"id": "s-0319", "domain": "dental clinic", "names": ["Check", "Clean", "Drill"], "text": "Check first, then Clean, and Drill only if needed. So Check to Clean is solid, Clean to Drill is dotted. The Drill gets a red color. Does Clean connect to Drill?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Check", "to": "Clean"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Clean", "to": "Drill", "style": "dotted"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Drill", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "connected", "target": "Clean", "anchor": "Drill"}}]}
{"id": "s-0320", "domain": "carpentry", "names": ["Saw", "Plank", "Nail"], "text": "The Saw cuts the Plank and the Nail holds it. I only need the Saw linked to the Plank, plain line. The Nail is a tiny gray triangle. Then drag the Nail near the Plank. Which thing is closest to the Plank?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Saw", "to": "Plank", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Nail", "shape": "triangle", "size": "tiny", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Nail", "position": "near", "anchor": "Plank"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Plank", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0321", "domain": "voting", "names": ["Voter", "Booth", "Urn"], "text": "A Voter walks to the Booth and then to the Urn. Link that. Make the Urn a square and the Booth a rectangle. Both should be navy. And finally say how many connections the Booth has.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Voter,Booth,Urn", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Urn", "shape": "square"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Booth", "shape": "rectangle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Booth,Urn", "color": "navy"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "degree", "target": "Booth"}}]}
{"id": "s-0322", "domain": "cloud", "names": ["Bucket", "Func", "Alert"], "text": "Each time a file lands in the Bucket, Func runs and triggers an Alert. So Bucket to Func to Alert. The Alert is a red triangle, I want it to be tiny. Bucket should be to the left of Func. Is there a path from Bucket to Alert?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Bucket,Func,Alert", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Alert", "shape": "triangle", "color": "red", "size": "tiny"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Bucket", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Func"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "path", "from": "Bucket", "to": "Alert"}}]}
{"id": "s-0323", "domain": "party", "names": ["Music", "Food", "Drinks"], "text": "Put the Music in the top left, Food in the bottom right and Drinks in the center. It's a house party so no problem if it looks a bit odd. Color the Drinks cyan. Describe the Drinks shape too.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Music", "position": "topLeft"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Food", "position": "bottomRight"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Drinks", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Drinks", "color": "cyan"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "describe", "target": "Drinks"}}]}
{"id": "s-0324", "domain": "zoology", "names": ["Mammal", "Bird", "Fish"], "text": "Mammals, birds and fish are classes. Make a group of three: arrange them in a row and colour each one differently, red, yellow, blue in that order. Is there a yellow shape? I'd say yes, but the app may disagree.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Mammal,Bird,Fish", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mammal", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Bird", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Fish", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "color": "yellow"}}]}
{"id": "s-0325", "domain": "office", "names": ["Printer", "Scanner"], "text": "Duplicate the Printer once, and put the copy below the Scanner. Colour that copy gray. I'd like both devices connected using a line with no arrows, the Printer and the Scanner. What's the new copy's colour?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Printer"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "$new", "position": "below", "anchor": "Scanner"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "$new", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Printer", "to": "Scanner", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "$new", "property": "color"}}]}
{"id": "s-0326", "domain": "hydroponics", "names": ["Tank", "Pump", "Tray"], "text": "Water goes Tank to Pump to Tray and back from Tray to Tank. That's the loop. Make the arrows blue. The Pump is a small hexagon. Count the connections for me.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Tank,Pump,Tray,Tank", "pairing": "chain", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pump", "shape": "hexagon", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "kind": "edge"}}]}
{"id": "s-0327", "domain": "universe", "names": ["Galaxy", "Star1", "Planet1"], "text": "Make a copy of Star1 twice, I mean duplicate it two times, and send the copies to the back. Planet1 is blue and sits near Star1. The Galaxy should be huge and purple. What is the biggest shape now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Star1", "count": "2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toBack", "target": "mention(quantifier=all,recency=newest)"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Planet1", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Planet1", "position": "near", "anchor": "Star1"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Galaxy", "size": "huge", "color": "purple"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "biggest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0328", "domain": "school", "names": ["Math", "Science", "Art"], "text": "Let's say Math is red, Science is green and Art is yellow. From now on every new triangle should be gray. Add a triangle called Break between Math and Science. Is the Break gray?", "wires": [{"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Math", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Science", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "fact", "args": {"target": "Art", "color": "yellow"}}, {"type": "rule", "args": {"shape": "triangle", "color": "gray"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "triangle", "name": "Break", "position": "between", "anchor": "Math,Science"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "$new", "color": "gray"}}]}
{"id": "s-0329", "domain": "logistics", "names": ["Hub", "Depot1", "Depot2"], "text": "I want the Hub connected to Depot1 and Depot2, but with plain lines that go both ways. Honestly the arrows are confusing. Make Depot2 larger than Depot1. Is Depot1 closer to the Hub than Depot2?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Hub", "to": "Depot1,Depot2", "arrow": "both"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Depot2"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Hub", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0330", "domain": "banking", "names": ["Account", "Loan", "Card"], "text": "An Account can have a Loan and a Card. Connect Account to both of them. Then make the Loan red, since it's debt, and the Card navy. Let me know if the Account is the most connected shape.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Account", "to": "Loan,Card"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Loan", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Card", "color": "navy"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}]}
{"id": "s-0331", "domain": "soccer", "names": ["Keeper", "Striker"], "text": "Place the Keeper at the bottom and the Striker at the top. Then add 4 small circles in a row in between, they are the midfielders. Colour all circles lime. Is the Striker above the Keeper?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Keeper", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Striker", "position": "top"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "size": "small", "count": "4", "position": "between", "anchor": "Keeper,Striker"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "mention(quantifier=all,shape=circle)", "color": "lime"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Striker", "position": "above", "anchor": "Keeper"}}]}
{"id": "s-0332", "domain": "museum", "names": ["Louvre", "Orsay"], "text": "Link Louvre with Orsay by a dotted line without arrowheads, it is the walking route. Make Orsay a hexagon. Then rename Louvre to Louvr2 hmm no, call it Mona. Color Mona gold.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Louvre", "to": "Orsay", "style": "dotted", "arrow": "none"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Orsay", "shape": "hexagon"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Louvre", "name": "Mona"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mona", "color": "gold"}}]}
{"id": "s-0333", "domain": "internet of things", "names": ["Thermo", "Hub", "App"], "text": "The thermostat reports to the hub and the hub notifies the app, both over wifi. Draw Thermo to Hub, Hub to App, dashed. Colour the app teal. Is the App reachable from the Thermo?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Thermo,Hub,App", "pairing": "chain", "style": "dashed"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "App", "color": "teal"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "reachable", "from": "Thermo"}}]}
{"id": "s-0334", "domain": "mythology", "names": ["Odin", "Thor", "Loki"], "text": "Odin fathered Thor and fathered Loki too, or adopted him, whatever. Draw arrows from Odin to each. Thor is a big red hexagon... no, a big red star. Loki is green. Tell me what Odin touches.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Odin", "to": "Thor,Loki"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Thor", "shape": "star", "size": "large", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Loki", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "neighbors", "target": "Odin"}}]}
{"id": "s-0335", "domain": "lab", "names": ["Mouse", "Cage", "Maze"], "text": "Put the Mouse into the Cage, I mean place it above the Cage, and the Maze to the right of the Cage. Then make everything small. Is the Mouse the tiniest thing?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Mouse", "position": "above", "anchor": "Cage"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Maze", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Cage"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "mention(quantifier=all)", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "smallest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0336", "domain": "team", "names": ["Lead", "Dev1", "Dev2", "Qa"], "text": "The Lead manages Dev1, Dev2 and Qa. Draw those three arrows. Make the Qa a diamond and colour it purple. Since the team grew, duplicate Dev1 once. What's the degree of the Lead?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Lead", "to": "Dev1,Dev2,Qa"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Qa", "shape": "diamond", "color": "purple"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Dev1"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "degree", "target": "Lead"}}]}
{"id": "s-0337", "domain": "nature", "names": ["Cloud", "Mountain"], "text": "Okay so the cloud sits above the mountain. Let me make that so: Cloud above Mountain. And the Mountain is a brown triangle, large. Add a white circle called Snow on top of it... I mean above it.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Cloud", "position": "above", "anchor": "Mountain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mountain", "shape": "triangle", "size": "large", "color": "brown"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "circle", "color": "white", "name": "Snow", "position": "above", "anchor": "Mountain"}}]}
{"id": "s-0338", "domain": "conference", "names": ["Talk1", "Talk2", "Break"], "text": "Make the schedule: Talk1, then Break, then Talk2. Connect them with arrows. The Break is green and small. Move the Break to the front, in case things overlap. Where is Talk2 relative to the Break?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Talk1,Break,Talk2", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Break", "color": "green", "size": "small"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toFront", "target": "Break"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Talk2", "property": "position"}}]}
{"id": "s-0339", "domain": "monastery", "names": ["Chapel", "Garden", "Cell"], "text": "Disconnect the Chapel from the Garden, they are too close in reality. Hmm, they were not even connected? Fine, then connect the Chapel to the Cell instead. The Cell should be small and white.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "disconnect", "from": "Chapel", "to": "Garden"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Chapel", "to": "Cell"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cell", "size": "small", "color": "white"}}]}
{"id": "s-0340", "domain": "e-commerce", "names": ["Cart", "Pay", "Ship"], "text": "Cart goes to Pay, Pay goes to Ship. Put them in a row and chain them. Then mark the Pay as a gold diamond, it's the critical step. How many diamonds exist?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Cart,Pay,Ship", "layout": "row"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Cart,Pay,Ship", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Pay", "shape": "diamond", "color": "gold"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "shape": "diamond"}}]}
{"id": "s-0341", "domain": "weather station", "names": ["Sensor", "Logger", "Display"], "text": "Sensor feeds Logger, Logger feeds Display. Simple. Make the Logger large and orange, the Display white. Then send the Sensor to the back, it covers a label.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Sensor,Logger,Display", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Logger", "size": "large", "color": "orange"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Display", "color": "white"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toBack", "target": "Sensor"}}]}
{"id": "s-0342", "domain": "yearbook", "names": ["Class", "Club", "Team"], "text": "Class, Club and Team all become circles. Do it, and colour each of them differently: red, green, blue. Then make the Club bigger because it's the most popular. Which colour is the Team?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Class,Club,Team", "shape": "circle"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Class", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Club", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Team", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Club"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "property", "target": "Team", "property": "color"}}]}
{"id": "s-0343", "domain": "city", "names": ["Bus", "Tram", "Metro"], "text": "The Bus and the Tram both end at Metro. Link them with arrows to the Metro. The Metro is the junction, so it should be huge and indigo. Which one is nearest to the Metro?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Bus,Tram", "to": "Metro"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Metro", "size": "huge", "color": "indigo"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Metro", "superlative": "closest"}}]}
{"id": "s-0344", "domain": "brainstorm", "names": ["Idea1", "Idea2"], "text": "Take Idea1 and Idea2 and put a gold star between them. Name it Winner. Then tie Idea1 to Winner with a green arrow. Also bring the Winner to the front, and shrink Idea2.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "star", "color": "gold", "name": "Winner", "position": "between", "anchor": "Idea1,Idea2"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Idea1", "to": "$new", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "toFront", "target": "$new"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "resize", "target": "Idea2"}}]}
{"id": "s-0345", "domain": "metro", "names": ["Line1", "Line2", "Line3"], "text": "Three lines: arrange them in a column and align them to the same vertical axis. Line1 is red, Line2 blue and Line3 green. Which is at the bottom?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Line1,Line2,Line3", "layout": "column"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "Line1,Line2,Line3", "axis": "vertical"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Line1", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Line2", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Line3", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "bottommost"}}]}
{"id": "s-0346", "domain": "cartography", "names": ["Island", "Reef"], "text": "The Island should be a big green ellipse in the center. The Reef goes around it, so put it near the Island. Add 2 tiny gray triangles for rocks. Do we have any hexagons? I forgot.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Island", "shape": "ellipse", "size": "large", "color": "green"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Island", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Reef", "position": "near", "anchor": "Island"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "create", "shape": "triangle", "size": "tiny", "color": "gray", "count": "2"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "exists", "shape": "hexagon"}}]}
{"id": "s-0347", "domain": "billing", "names": ["Plan", "Seat", "Add"], "text": "I'd like the Plan, Seat and Add boxes joined: Plan to Seat, Plan to Add. Colour the Plan blue. Disconnect Plan from Add straight away, I decided it's bundled. Is Add alone now?", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Plan", "to": "Seat,Add"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Plan", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "disconnect", "from": "Plan", "to": "Add"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "degree", "target": "Add"}}]}
{"id": "s-0348", "domain": "farm to table", "names": ["Farm", "Truck", "Market"], "text": "Put the Market at the top and the Farm at the bottom, trucks run between. The Truck goes between Farm and Market. Chain Farm, Truck and Market with arrows, and make the Truck yellow.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Market", "position": "top"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Farm", "position": "bottom"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Truck", "position": "between", "anchor": "Farm,Market"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Farm,Truck,Market", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Truck", "color": "yellow"}}]}
{"id": "s-0349", "domain": "campfire", "names": ["Fire", "Log", "Tent"], "text": "Fire in the middle, Logs to the left, Tent to the right. Oh and the Fire is a big red star. Is the Log directly next to the Tent? I'd rather it wasn't, because of sparks.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Fire", "position": "center"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Log", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "Fire"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Tent", "position": "rightOf", "anchor": "Fire"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Fire", "shape": "star", "size": "large", "color": "red"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Log", "position": "near", "anchor": "Tent"}}]}
{"id": "s-0350", "domain": "toy robots", "names": ["Bolt", "Gear", "Chip"], "text": "Bolt and Gear and Chip: make all three huge. No, medium. The Chip is blue. Hook the Gear up to the Chip with a double arrow, and then tell me which one is the leftmost.", "wires": [{"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Bolt,Gear,Chip", "size": "medium"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Chip", "color": "blue"}}, {"type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Gear", "to": "Chip", "arrow": "both"}}, {"type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "leftmost"}}]}
